WEBVTT

00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:02.559
Rashad Robinson: Thank you.
And thank you for having me.

00:10:02.583 --> 00:10:05.059
It's an opportunity that I'm taking today

00:10:05.083 --> 00:10:07.601
to just tell you
about how you can get involved.

00:10:07.625 --> 00:10:09.268
How you can take action,

00:10:09.292 --> 00:10:12.226
because right now,
strategic action is critical

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.643
for all of us to do the work
to change the rules

00:10:15.667 --> 00:10:19.143
that far too often
keep the systems in place

00:10:19.167 --> 00:10:20.434
that hold us back.

00:10:20.458 --> 00:10:21.934
Make no mistake,

00:10:21.958 --> 00:10:24.726
the criminal justice system is not broken.

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:28.875
It is operating exactly
the way it was designed.